OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigation after contractor
OL,4,Adies at Blenheim Palace
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation has been launched
OL,7,Fafter a man was killed by a tipper
OL,8,Ftruck on the grounds of Blenheim
OL,9,FPalace.
OL,11,FThames Valley Police said it was called
OL,12,Fto the Unesco World Heritage site at
OL,13,Fabout 13:00 BST on 14 October following
OL,14,Fan incident on the palace grounds.
OL,16,FIt said a 50-year-old man had died in
OL,17,Fthe "industrial incident", and that it
OL,18,Fwas investigating the fatality
OL,19,Falongside the Health and Safety
OL,20,FExecutive (HSE).
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
